id: pm-gknu
title: "Uniform multi-value filter-value grammar: --status accepts CSV but --type/--priority fail fast and --tag silently matches the literal CSV string"
description: "Unify multi-value filter parsing so status, type, priority, tag, assignee, sprint, and release accept one predictable CSV grammar with explicit literal-comma handling."
