acceptance_criteria: "every enumerable filter flag on list/search/aggregate/update-many (--type, --priority, --status, --assignee, --sprint, --release) accepts the same CSV multi-value grammar as --status with per-token validation and fail-fast on any invalid token; free-form --tag defines explicit CSV OR-semantics with a documented escape for literal commas; contracts + docs + completion updated via the full new-flag checklist; no existing single-value spelling breaks"
