resolution: "Shipped one public SDK parser and uniform OR filter execution across list, search, aggregate, and update-many."
expected_result: Every enumerable query selector accepts repeatable and CSV OR values with token validation and documented literal-comma escaping.
actual_result: "SDK, CLI flag contracts, docs, snapshots, integration tests, npx, Bun/bunx, and bulk dry-run consumers all prove the shared grammar."
